WEBVTT

00:08.000 --> 00:09.344
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.413 --> 00:10.965
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:11.034 --> 00:12.482
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.551 --> 00:14.586
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.655 --> 00:17.586
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.655 --> 00:19.620
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.689 --> 00:21.689
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.758 --> 00:23.517
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.586 --> 00:25.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.517 --> 00:27.655
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.724 --> 00:29.724
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.793 --> 00:31.620
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.689 --> 00:33.620
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.689 --> 00:35.413
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.482 --> 00:37.724
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.793 --> 00:39.655
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.724 --> 00:40.965
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.034 --> 00:42.827
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.896 --> 00:45.551
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.620 --> 00:47.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.931 --> 00:49.620
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:02.758 --> 01:04.413
[klank, klunk]
[叮当，叮当]

01:04.482 --> 01:06.793
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

01:09.965 --> 01:11.655
- Welcome, everyone,
- 欢迎大家，

01:11.724 --> 01:14.862
to the Secret Anchor
Arm Wrestling Club.
到秘密锚
扳手腕俱乐部。

01:14.931 --> 01:16.862
- Oh, yeah!
- 哦，是的！

01:16.931 --> 01:18.517
[cheering]
[欢呼]

01:18.586 --> 01:20.793
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:20.862 --> 01:24.310
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

01:24.379 --> 01:26.275
- Give it up, old man.
- 放弃吧，老家伙。

01:26.344 --> 01:29.103
You're nothing but
a soft shell, Krabs.
你不过是
软壳，螃蟹。

01:29.172 --> 01:32.689
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

01:32.758 --> 01:35.068
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

01:35.137 --> 01:37.655
- [grunts]
[cheers and applause]
- [咕哝]
[欢呼和掌声]

01:37.724 --> 01:39.241
- Yeah!
- 是的！

01:39.310 --> 01:41.655
- I win! Again.
- 我赢了！再次。

01:41.724 --> 01:43.103
[laughing]
[笑]

01:43.172 --> 01:45.620
That's me penny pinching hand.
这就是我的吝啬手。

01:45.689 --> 01:47.413
[laughing]
[笑]

01:47.482 --> 01:50.344
[cheering]
[欢呼]

01:50.413 --> 01:52.586
both: Hup, hup, hup, hup, hup.
两者：哈，哈，哈，哈，哈。

01:53.517 --> 01:58.034
- This old soft shell is ready
to twist another wrist.
- 这个旧的软壳已经准备好了
扭转另一只手腕。

01:58.103 --> 02:00.827
Who's next?
下一个是谁？

02:00.896 --> 02:04.379
- Oh.
- [laughing]
- 哦。
- [笑]

02:05.482 --> 02:06.896
- I am!
- 我是！

02:06.965 --> 02:08.034
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

02:08.103 --> 02:10.310
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:10.379 --> 02:12.310
[all murmuring]
[大家窃窃私语]

02:12.379 --> 02:16.551
- You got a problem
with that, Eugene?
- 你有问题
尤金？

02:16.620 --> 02:20.413
[laughing]
His name's Eugene, by the way.
[笑]
顺便说一下，他的名字叫尤金。

02:20.482 --> 02:23.551
- [laughing]
I got no problem with that,
- [笑]
我对此没有任何问题，

02:23.620 --> 02:25.827
Shel-don.
谢尔登。

02:25.896 --> 02:29.103
His name's Sheldon, by the way.
顺便说一下，他的名字叫谢尔顿。

02:29.172 --> 02:31.034
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

02:31.103 --> 02:34.655
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

02:38.137 --> 02:40.172
[bell chimes]
[钟声]

02:40.241 --> 02:42.379
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

02:42.448 --> 02:45.655
- It's humiliation time,
Krab-cake.
- 羞辱的时刻到了
蟹肉蛋糕。

02:45.724 --> 02:49.620
I've been working out
for months to bring you down.
我一直在锻炼
几个月来让你失望。

02:49.689 --> 02:51.655
[growling]
[咆哮]

02:51.724 --> 02:52.896
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

02:52.965 --> 02:55.310
What's...goin' on here?
这里……发生什么事了？

02:55.379 --> 02:58.793
I can't...hold it!
- Any last words?
我……撑不住了！
- 最后还有什么话要说吗？

02:58.862 --> 03:01.482
- Just...one.
- 只是……一个。

03:02.827 --> 03:04.586
Sucker!
傻瓜！

03:06.586 --> 03:08.206
[laughter]
[笑声]

03:08.275 --> 03:09.896
- Yeah!
- 是的！

03:09.965 --> 03:11.241
- Next!
- 下一个！

03:13.965 --> 03:16.448
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

03:17.551 --> 03:20.103
- Next!
- 下一个！

03:20.172 --> 03:22.310
- I'll get--
- 我会得到--

03:22.379 --> 03:24.137
- Next!
- You--
- 下一个！
- 你 -

03:24.206 --> 03:25.793
- Next!
- Krabs.
- 下一个！
- 螃蟹。

03:29.724 --> 03:32.931
- [laughing]
- [笑]

03:33.000 --> 03:34.793
I'm the champion,
我是冠军，

03:34.862 --> 03:36.793
hands down.
双手放下。

03:36.862 --> 03:39.517
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

03:43.275 --> 03:45.793
- I'll get you for this, Krabs.
- 我会抓住你的，蟹蟹。

03:45.862 --> 03:47.620
You'll rue the day you--
有一天你会后悔的——

03:47.689 --> 03:48.655
Aah!
啊啊！

03:48.724 --> 03:50.413
- Yeah!
- 是的！

03:52.655 --> 03:54.827
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

03:54.896 --> 03:57.482
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

03:57.551 --> 04:01.275
Oh, why do I try
to compete with Krabs?
哦，我为什么要尝试
与蟹蟹竞争？

04:01.344 --> 04:04.758
He always goes long
and I always fall short.
他总是走得很远
而我总是达不到要求。

04:04.827 --> 04:08.551
Will I ever get the upper hand?
我会占据上风吗？

04:08.620 --> 04:10.310
Huh?
啊？

04:10.379 --> 04:12.344
[clam cawing]
[蛤叫声]

04:12.413 --> 04:13.862
That's it!
就是这样！

04:13.931 --> 04:15.586
My glove!
我的手套！

04:15.655 --> 04:19.896
My big, beautiful,
bone-crushing glove!
我的大，美丽，
碎骨手套！

04:19.965 --> 04:23.724
Thank you, clam.
- [caw]
谢谢你，蛤蜊。
- [哇]

04:23.793 --> 04:25.965
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

04:26.034 --> 04:28.206
[laughs]
[笑]

04:28.275 --> 04:31.862
[thunder crashing]
[雷霆轰鸣]

04:31.931 --> 04:32.931
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

04:33.000 --> 04:36.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:36.931 --> 04:39.517
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

04:39.586 --> 04:41.862
- The pinky is wiggling!
- 小指在扭动！

04:41.931 --> 04:44.068
Wiggling!
扭动！

04:44.137 --> 04:46.862
[laughs menacingly]
[威胁性地笑]

04:46.931 --> 04:49.724
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

04:54.448 --> 04:57.965
- Let's see Krabs
throw down this gauntlet.
- 让我们看看螃蟹
放下这个挑战。

04:58.034 --> 05:00.172
[laughing]
[笑]

05:00.241 --> 05:01.827
Hiyah!
- [groaning]
嗨！
- [呻吟]

05:01.896 --> 05:04.310
[neighing]
[嘶嘶声]

05:06.379 --> 05:07.793
- Ohh...
- 哦...

05:09.344 --> 05:10.310
- Ohh...
- 哦...

05:10.379 --> 05:12.965
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

05:13.034 --> 05:14.000
- Ohh...
- 哦...

05:15.482 --> 05:18.103
- I want a rematch, Krabs.
- 我想要重赛，蟹蟹。

05:18.172 --> 05:19.931
- Bor-ing.
- 无聊的。

05:20.000 --> 05:21.896
But, whatevs.
但是，无论如何。

05:21.965 --> 05:24.241
- [gasps]
Oh, no,
- [喘气]
哦，不，

05:24.310 --> 05:27.620
not a hand cramp.
Not now!
不是手抽筋。
现在不要！

05:27.689 --> 05:31.379
Luckily, I have a last-minute
substitution standing by.
幸运的是，我还有最后一刻
替补待命。

05:31.448 --> 05:32.758
[whistle blows]
[哨声响起]

05:32.827 --> 05:35.758
[thudding steps]
[重重的脚步声]

05:35.827 --> 05:37.862
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

05:38.724 --> 05:39.862
- Ow!
- 噢！

05:39.931 --> 05:42.206
[thudding]
[重击]

05:42.275 --> 05:43.413
- Ooh--
- 噢--

05:45.758 --> 05:48.206
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

05:48.275 --> 05:49.241
[bell chimes]
[钟声]

05:49.310 --> 05:52.310
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:52.379 --> 05:54.758
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:00.206 --> 06:02.517
[shouting]
[喊叫]

06:02.586 --> 06:05.103
Any...last...words?
有什么……最后的话吗？

06:05.172 --> 06:06.344
- [laughing]
- [笑]

06:06.413 --> 06:07.689
[whistle blows]
[哨声响起]

06:07.758 --> 06:09.482
- [groaning]
Wha--
- [呻吟]
什——

06:09.551 --> 06:11.275
- Just one.
- 只有一个。

06:11.344 --> 06:13.137
Sucker!
傻瓜！

06:13.206 --> 06:14.758
[laughing]
[笑]

06:14.827 --> 06:16.689
- Wait, wait, wait,
wait, wait now--
- 等等，等等，等等，
等等，现在等等——

06:16.758 --> 06:17.827
Aah--
啊啊——

06:20.896 --> 06:23.896
Huh? No, no, no,
no-no-no-no!
啊？不不不，
不不不不！

06:26.758 --> 06:28.862
- Ta-da!
- 哒哒！

06:28.931 --> 06:32.793
Let's give a big hand
to the new champion.
让我们伸出大手
到新的冠军。

06:34.206 --> 06:35.517
[whistle blows]
[哨声响起]

06:35.586 --> 06:38.551
Okay, move it, filthy fingers.
好吧，移动它，肮脏的手指。

06:38.620 --> 06:40.620
Hiyah!
- [gasps, whimpers]
嗨！
- [喘息，呜咽]

06:44.172 --> 06:47.896
- Aw, too bad Krabs
isn't here to catch me
- 噢，蟹蟹太糟糕了
不是来抓我的

06:47.965 --> 06:50.206
with my glove
in the cookie jar.
用我的手套
在饼干罐里。

06:50.275 --> 06:52.827
[laughing]
Bust the doors!
[笑]
破门而入！

06:52.896 --> 06:55.724
[whip slaps]
- [neighing]
[鞭打]
- [嘶嘶声]

06:58.689 --> 07:01.034
- Bust this one, too!
- 把这个也搞垮了！

07:01.103 --> 07:03.103
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

07:05.172 --> 07:06.931
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:08.103 --> 07:11.344
- And now,
for the secret formula.
- 现在，
为秘密配方。

07:11.413 --> 07:13.241
Open says me!
开放说我！

07:13.310 --> 07:15.344
[whip snaps]
- [groaning]
[鞭子啪地响]
- [呻吟]

07:15.413 --> 07:17.172
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:17.241 --> 07:19.172
[whip snaps]
[鞭子啪地响]

07:19.241 --> 07:21.448
- Don't hand me that.
- 别把那个递给我。

07:21.517 --> 07:23.344
I command you!
我命令你！

07:23.413 --> 07:25.758
Please don't hurt me!
请不要伤害我！

07:27.482 --> 07:28.827
Whew.
呼。

07:28.896 --> 07:30.137
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

07:35.241 --> 07:36.793
[sizzles]
[嘶嘶声]

07:36.862 --> 07:38.655
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

07:38.724 --> 07:39.758
[yelling]
Hot! Hot sauce!
[大喊]
热！辣酱！

07:39.827 --> 07:42.517
Aah!
[gibbering]
啊啊！
[胡言乱语]

07:52.034 --> 07:53.655
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:53.724 --> 07:55.551
- Look out!
- Huh?
- 小心！
- 啊？

07:56.379 --> 07:57.655
- Oh!
- 哦！

07:59.551 --> 08:02.413
[glove growling]
[手套咆哮]

08:02.482 --> 08:05.206
- Uh-oh.
That glove is gonna destroy
- 呃哦。
那手套会毁掉

08:05.275 --> 08:07.655
Bikini Bottom, and I'm gonna
get blamed for it.
比基尼泳裤，我要
受到指责。

08:07.724 --> 08:10.655
[gasps]
I hate prison food!
[喘气]
我讨厌监狱里的食物！

08:10.724 --> 08:13.482
But I can't stop
that monster all by myself.
但我无法停止
那个怪物全是我一个人。

08:13.551 --> 08:15.482
This is an emergency!
这是紧急情况！

08:15.551 --> 08:17.896
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

08:19.103 --> 08:21.137
"Emergency Box."
“急救箱。”

08:21.206 --> 08:23.482
That's convenient.
那很方便。

08:26.172 --> 08:27.827
- [laughs]
Morning.
- [笑]
早上。

08:27.896 --> 08:30.034
What is your emergency, sir?
先生，您有什么紧急情况吗？

08:30.103 --> 08:31.655
Oh, hi, Plankton.
哦，嗨，浮游生物。

08:31.724 --> 08:32.862
- I need a hand
with something, kid.
- 我需要一只手
有东西，孩子。

08:32.931 --> 08:34.827
Hop to it.
- Don't worry, sir.
跳到它。
- 别担心，先生。

08:34.896 --> 08:38.034
No matter what the emergency,
I've seen it all before.
无论遇到什么紧急情况，
我以前见过这一切。

08:43.413 --> 08:45.206
- [yells]
- [大喊]

08:45.275 --> 08:47.896
- I've never seen that before!
- 我以前从未见过！

08:49.413 --> 08:52.241
- Usually it's sitting quietly
on top of the Chum Bucket.
- 通常它会安静地坐着
在密友桶的顶部。

08:52.310 --> 08:55.758
- Well maybe we can talk to it.
- Talk is cheap.
- 好吧，也许我们可以和它谈谈。
- 谈话是廉价的。

08:55.827 --> 08:59.896
I just need you to push
this button when I say so.
我只需要你推动
当我这么说时这个按钮。

09:05.448 --> 09:07.137
Hey, fist-face!
嘿嘿，拳头脸！

09:07.206 --> 09:09.448
Prepare for annihilation.
做好歼灭的准备。

09:09.517 --> 09:11.689
Push the button, SpongeBob.
按下按钮，海绵宝宝。

09:11.758 --> 09:13.931
[laughing]
Huh?
[笑]
啊？

09:14.000 --> 09:15.620
- [sobbing]
I can't do it.
- [抽泣]
我做不到。

09:15.689 --> 09:18.689
I can't shoot the glove.
It's wiggling.
我不能射击手套。
它在摇摆。

09:22.655 --> 09:25.275
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

09:26.758 --> 09:28.482
- [whimpering]
- I said, push it!
- [呜咽]
- 我说，推吧！

09:28.551 --> 09:30.620
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:30.689 --> 09:31.655
[rapid beeping]
[快速的蜂鸣声]

09:31.724 --> 09:33.758
[laughing]
What?
[笑]
什么？

09:33.827 --> 09:36.758
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:36.827 --> 09:38.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:38.827 --> 09:41.758
- [screeches]
- [尖叫声]

09:44.275 --> 09:46.586
- [panting]
Why are you here, again?
- [气喘吁吁]
你怎么又来了？

09:46.655 --> 09:48.206
- I'm helping.
- 我在帮忙。

09:48.275 --> 09:50.413
[laughs]
[笑]

09:50.482 --> 09:52.068
Listen to me, Plankton.
听我说，浮游生物。

09:52.137 --> 09:54.931
You can't fight a big monster
like that with hate.
你无法对抗大怪物
像那样充满仇恨。

09:55.000 --> 09:58.068
You can only defeat
them with love.
你只能打败
他们充满爱。

10:01.103 --> 10:02.931
- Blaaaghhh!
- 巴拉啊！

10:03.000 --> 10:04.172
Love?
爱？

10:04.241 --> 10:05.517
Yikes.
哎呀。

10:05.586 --> 10:07.931
That's too brutal.
这也太残忍了吧

10:08.000 --> 10:10.275
Let's do it!
我们开始做吧！

10:16.896 --> 10:19.793
- Ooh, we're in disguise.
[giggles]
- 哦，我们乔装打扮了。
[咯咯笑]

10:19.862 --> 10:23.137
- Pipe down, SpongeBob,
or you'll blow our glover!
- 管道下来，海绵宝宝，
不然你会吹坏我们的手套的！

10:23.206 --> 10:24.965
I mean cover!
我是说掩护！

10:30.379 --> 10:32.379
- [feminine giggle]
- [女性咯咯笑]

10:32.448 --> 10:35.689
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

10:35.758 --> 10:38.551
- [giggles]
- Ooh.
- [咯咯笑]
- 哦。

10:38.620 --> 10:41.137
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

10:44.275 --> 10:45.689
Ooh-hoo-hoo-hoo.
哦呼呼呼。

10:45.758 --> 10:48.724
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

10:51.931 --> 10:55.862
- [grunting]
- [giggling]
- [咕哝]
- [咯咯笑]

10:59.793 --> 11:03.586
- It's working, SpongeBob.
He's in love.
- 成功了，海绵宝宝。
他恋爱了。

11:03.655 --> 11:05.655
[laughs]
The big dope.
[笑]
大笨蛋。

11:05.724 --> 11:07.827
- [giggles]
Love.
- [咯咯笑]
爱。

11:09.241 --> 11:11.655
Ooh! Ha.
Mm!
哦！哈。
毫米！

11:11.724 --> 11:13.827
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

11:13.896 --> 11:16.724
- Oh.
- [humming]
- 哦。
- [嗡嗡声]

11:22.482 --> 11:24.482
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

11:24.551 --> 11:26.689
[slurping]
[发出声音]

11:32.344 --> 11:33.413
[gasps]
[喘气]

11:33.482 --> 11:36.000
- Check, please.
- 请检查。

11:37.724 --> 11:39.379
- [growls]
- [shouts]
- [咆哮]
- [喊叫]

11:39.448 --> 11:41.310
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

11:41.379 --> 11:44.068
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

11:45.482 --> 11:48.689
- I'm sorry, Plankton.
You came to me for help
- 对不起，浮游生物。
你来找我帮忙

11:48.758 --> 11:52.310
and I failed.
[sobbing]
我失败了。
[抽泣]

11:56.206 --> 11:58.551
[coughs]
It's all right, kid.
[咳嗽]
没关系，孩子。

11:58.620 --> 12:00.689
Keep your pants on.
穿上你的裤子。

12:00.758 --> 12:03.310
- Huh?
Keep my pants on?
- 啊？
还把我的裤子穿上吗？

12:03.379 --> 12:07.172
Keep my pants on!
That's a great idea.
穿上我的裤子！
这是个好主意。

12:07.241 --> 12:10.310
- Are you insane?
I said keep them on!
- 你疯了吗？
我说让他们继续吧！

12:10.379 --> 12:13.965
- Don't worry, you'll see.
[clears throat]
- 别担心，你会看到的。
[清嗓子]

12:14.034 --> 12:16.689
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

12:16.758 --> 12:18.103
- You do.
- Yeah!
- 你做。
- 是的！

12:18.172 --> 12:19.655
- [shouts]
- [喊叫]

12:19.724 --> 12:21.172
- Thanks for the pants, Hans,
- 谢谢你的裤子，汉斯，

12:21.241 --> 12:23.379
but could you help me
with another problem?
但你能帮我吗
有另一个问题吗？

12:23.448 --> 12:25.827
- I'm always here to help you,
SpongeBob.
- 我随时为你提供帮助
海绵宝宝。

12:25.896 --> 12:26.827
High five.
高五。

12:26.896 --> 12:28.241
- High five!
- 高五！

12:28.310 --> 12:30.241
- Ouch!
- 哎呀！

12:30.310 --> 12:33.275
I get it.
To catch a huge glove,
我得到它。
为了抓住一只巨大的手套，

12:33.344 --> 12:35.241
you need a huge hand.
你需要一双大手。

12:35.310 --> 12:37.448
- Oh, yeah.
- 哦，是的。

12:37.517 --> 12:39.896
- You're a genius, SquarePants!
- 你真是个天才，方裤！

12:39.965 --> 12:41.689
- That old glove could
be anywhere by now.
- 那只旧手套可以
现在就在任何地方。

12:41.758 --> 12:43.413
How are we gonna find him?
我们要怎么找到他？

12:43.482 --> 12:46.206
- Hmm, let's see.
If I was a glove,
- 嗯，让我们看看。
假如我是一只手套

12:46.275 --> 12:48.620
where would I go?
我该去哪里？

12:48.689 --> 12:51.206
- Ooh, ooh, I know!
- 哦，哦，我知道！

12:51.275 --> 12:54.758
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

12:54.827 --> 12:56.965
- Daddy, I want it.
- 爸爸，我想要它。

12:57.034 --> 12:59.275
- Now, Timmy, you already
have one of those
- 现在，蒂米，你已经
有其中之一

12:59.344 --> 13:00.931
glove toys at home.
家里的手套玩具。

13:01.000 --> 13:03.310
- Not this one.
That one!
- 不是这个。
那个！

13:03.379 --> 13:04.793
- [shouts]
- [喊叫]

13:04.862 --> 13:07.310
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

13:12.551 --> 13:14.655
- Uh-oh.
- [growls]
- 呃哦。
- [咆哮]

13:14.724 --> 13:17.586
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

13:17.655 --> 13:20.275
- Hey, Glove-zilla!
- 嘿，手套齐拉！

13:20.344 --> 13:23.551
Someone needs to teach
you some Swedish manners.
需要有人来教导
你有点瑞典礼仪。

13:23.620 --> 13:25.344
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

13:25.413 --> 13:27.172
[yelling]
[大喊]

13:27.241 --> 13:29.517
both:
Sic 'em, Hans!
两者：
算了，汉斯！

13:29.586 --> 13:31.448
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

13:37.344 --> 13:39.827
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

13:41.172 --> 13:43.310
- I challenge you to a duel.
- 我向你发起决斗挑战。

13:43.379 --> 13:46.379
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

13:47.793 --> 13:51.068
- Give him the old five
finger discount, Hans!
- 把老五给他
手指折扣，汉斯！

13:51.137 --> 13:53.689
- But only love
with defeat the glove.
- 但只有爱
打败手套。

13:53.758 --> 13:56.344
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

14:00.413 --> 14:03.896
Oh, look, they're playing
rock, paper, scissors!
哦，看，他们在玩
石头、剪刀、布！

14:03.965 --> 14:07.241
One, two, three...
一二三...

14:08.862 --> 14:10.620
- Yeah!
Nothing beats scissors.
- 是的！
没有什么比剪刀更好的了。

14:10.689 --> 14:13.724
- Oh, except rock.
- 哦，除了摇滚。

14:13.793 --> 14:15.482
[both whimper]
[两人都呜咽]

14:15.551 --> 14:18.310
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

14:19.758 --> 14:22.413
Oh, my goodness.
It's a thumb war.
哦，我的天啊。
这是一场拇指战争。

14:22.482 --> 14:24.862
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

14:24.931 --> 14:27.655
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:27.724 --> 14:30.586
[both shouting]
[两人大喊]

14:38.931 --> 14:41.241
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

14:44.103 --> 14:47.344
[intense music]
[激烈的音乐]

14:47.413 --> 14:53.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:53.172 --> 14:55.241
- I can't beat the glove,
SpongeBob.
- 我无法击败手套，
海绵宝宝。

14:55.310 --> 14:58.793
It's too strong.
You need to create a diversion.
它味道太浓。
你需要创造一个转移。

14:58.862 --> 15:01.413
- Diversion, eh?
Hmm...
- 转移注意力，嗯？
唔...

15:01.482 --> 15:02.689
- Hmm...
- 唔...

15:02.758 --> 15:05.103
- Hmm...
- 唔...

15:05.172 --> 15:07.758
- Hmm...
Oh!
- 嗯...
哦！

15:07.827 --> 15:09.103
Aha!
啊哈！

15:09.172 --> 15:11.379
No.
Hmm...
不。
嗯...

15:13.586 --> 15:14.896
Hmm...
唔...

15:14.965 --> 15:17.310
- Hmm...
- 唔...

15:17.379 --> 15:20.103
- We need a bullhorn, stat.
- 我们需要一个扩音器，统计数据。

15:21.655 --> 15:24.137
- I am a bullhorn, stat!
- 我是扩音器，统计！

15:26.620 --> 15:28.172
- Hey, finger face.
- 嘿，手指脸。

15:28.241 --> 15:30.931
Your grandma was a combat boot.
你的祖母是一双战斗靴。

15:31.000 --> 15:32.379
[laughing]
[笑]

15:32.448 --> 15:34.620
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

15:34.689 --> 15:37.379
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

15:37.448 --> 15:40.379
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

15:40.448 --> 15:41.931
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

15:42.000 --> 15:45.275
- I've got him!
How do I look?
- 我抓到他了！
我看起来怎么样？

15:53.172 --> 15:55.620
- Aw, they fit each
other just like a glove.
- 哦，它们都很合适
其他就像手套一样。

15:55.689 --> 15:57.310
[laughs]
[笑]

15:57.379 --> 16:00.137
- [laughs]
Hardy-har-har.
- [笑]
哈代哈哈。

16:00.206 --> 16:02.310
- He's harmless now,
SpongeBob.
- 他现在已经无害了
海绵宝宝。

16:02.379 --> 16:04.862
See you tomorrow morning.
I'll bring the pants.
明天早上见。
我会把裤子带来。

16:04.931 --> 16:06.586
- [laughing]
- [笑]

16:06.655 --> 16:08.137
What?
Hey!
什么？
嘿！

16:08.206 --> 16:12.000
Come back.
That glove is irreplaceable.
回来。
那只手套是无可替代的。

16:12.068 --> 16:14.344
Or is it?
或者是吗？

16:14.413 --> 16:15.655
[grunts]
[咕哝]

16:15.724 --> 16:18.344
That looks way better
than a glove.
看起来好多了
比手套。

16:18.413 --> 16:21.896
And it's a combat boot,
to boot.
而且还是一款战斗靴
启动。

16:21.965 --> 16:25.448
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

16:25.517 --> 16:27.344
Ouch!
哎哟!

16:27.413 --> 16:30.931
- Yeah!
- 是的！

- 是的！